{"reply":"In chapter 8, “The Queen’s Croquet-Ground,” Two explains that the gardeners planted a white rose-tree by mistake and are painting it red before the Queen arrives, fearing, “if the Queen was to find it out, we should all have our heads cut off, you know.”

Your note says you found the billing mistake was yours, fixed it over the weekend, said nothing on Monday, and kept telling yourself it was already handled. A 2023 cross-sectional survey of hospital nurses found that leader inclusiveness, safety climate, and psychological safety significantly affected willingness to report errors; psychological safety mediated the relationships between safety climate and reporting, and between leader inclusiveness and reporting ([the study](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10599306/)).

